    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39997" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλε-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smooth over</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.74d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄκρα τῶν βλεφάρων</span>,
